OL,3,GNEWSAFamily keeping dog's memory alive
OL,4,Aaround the world
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grieving family's creative project to
OL,7,Fkeep the memory of their beloved dog
OL,8,Falive is going global.
OL,10,FThe Simpkins family, from Devizes in
OL,11,FWiltshire, lost their 13-year-old
OL,12,FAustralian Kelpie, Harvey, in August.
OL,13,FTo cope with their grief, they started
OL,14,Fpainting rocks and hiding them in the
OL,15,Ftown and surrounding areas for people
OL,16,Fto find.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
