OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAFamily keeping dog's memory alive
OL,4,Aaround the world
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnybody who finds a rock is asked to
OL,7,Fpost it on Harvey Rocks Facebook page,
OL,8,Fbefore hiding it again for somebody
OL,9,Felse. Some of the rocks found in
OL,10,FDevizes have been taken to Spain and
OL,11,Fthe United States.
OL,13,FKatie Simpkins said: "It's given us a
OL,14,Fway to talk about Harvey in a positive
OL,15,Fway and to distract away from the
OL,16,Fsadness a bit. It keeps his memory
OL,17,Falive in a happy way."
